## Rows skipped

- es-a #9 — “por cada 1 víctima y cada 1 accidente” → drop the digits. Korean source is “피해자 1명·사고 1건당”. Those two 1s are real digits, not a lexical 제N호. Dropping them fails numbers. Left as is.
- es-a #10 and es-b #8 — delete U+200B blank lines, and (es-a #10) promote Q16–Q20 to `##` headings. The checker requires the same ZWSP count and the same heading levels as the Korean source, which has the same padding. Characters removed: 0. Headings added: 0.
- es-a #12 — “inciso 6” → “apartado 6”. Not applied. See disagreements. Also, the checker maps Spanish “inciso” to 호 and “apartado” to 항; swapping them would unmatch 제6호 and fail numbers on the digit 6.
- es-a #18 — delete “(la fuente lo cita como artículo 10)”. The URL is already flno=3 and was not touched. The Korean link text is 영업세법 제10조. Removing the parenthetical fails numbers (`missing from translation (1): 10`). Parenthetical restored. The visible statute name stays artículo 3 de las Normas sobre los tipos de retención (各類所得扣繳率標準).
- es-a #21 — reformat “TWD 1.57M”. ACCEPTED-ROUND: the bio figure stays byte-identical.
- es-a #22 — remove a leading space on servicesAssistanceAfter. See disagreements. The space was added, not removed.

